bonus_start > i
3

rule buchung_regel event:i > &ii
state total:i=4 bonus:i=bonus_start
when eq event 1 -> total=keep, bonus=set + bonus 2
when eq event 4 -> total=set + total bonus, bonus=reset
when eq event 2 -> total=reset, bonus=keep
when if eq event 3 > bonus total false -> total=keep, bonus=set total
else -> total=keep, bonus=keep
out pair total bonus

buchung_funktion total:i bonus:i event:i > &ii
if eq event 1 pair total + bonus 2
if eq event 4 pair + total bonus bonus_start
if eq event 2 pair 4 bonus
if eq event 3 pair total if > bonus total total bonus
pair total bonus
